            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Benyamini ni Bela na Bekeri na Yediyayeli, ukw ari batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo kuri Bela ni Esiboni na Uzi na Uziyeli na Yerimoti na Iri, ukw ari batanu, abakuru bo mu mazu ya ba sekuruza, kandi bār’ abahizi; uko banditswe mu gitabo kibadōndōra bār’ ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bibiri n’abantu mirongwitatu na bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo kuri Bekeri ni Zemira na Yowasi na Eliyezeri na Eliyowenayi na Omuri na Yeremoti na Abiya na Anatoti na Alemeti; abo bose bandurutse kuri Bekeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bār’ abakuru bo mu mazu ya ba sekuruza, kandi bār’ abahizi; uko banditswe mu gitabo kibadōndōra, uk’ urunganwe rwabo rwagenda rukurikirana, bār’ ibihumbi mirongwibiri n’amajana abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwene Yediyayeli ni Biluhani; abo kuri Biluhani ni Yushi na Benyamini na Ehudi na Kenana na Zetani na Tarushishi na Ahishahari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bose bār’ abo kuri Yediyayeli, nk’ukw abakuru b’amazu ya ba sekuruza bāri bari, ar’ abantu b’abahizi ibihumbi cumi n’indwi n’amajana abiri, bashobora kuja mu ntambara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Shupimu na Hupimu bār’ abo kuri Iri, bo na Hushimu wo kuri Aheri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
